{"id":"wb-6-90","name":"小仙坛窑址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"小仙坛窑址","text":"小仙坛窑址位于浙江省绍兴市上虞区上浦镇石浦村北200米，是一座东汉时期的越窑青瓷窑址。面积约800平方米，窑炉破坏严重。该窑址的发现表明早在东汉时期，成熟的瓷器已在浙江烧造成功。2006年5月25日列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BB%99%E5%9D%9B%E7%AA%91%E5%9D%80","revisionId":89547639,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89547639","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2255c57956cc3c3692f393d2.jpg","title":"上虞小仙坛窑址,_2021-02-14_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%8A%E8%99%9E%E5%B0%8F%E4%BB%99%E5%9D%9B%E7%AA%91%E5%9D%80,_2021-02-14_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/%E4%B8%8A%E8%99%9E%E5%B0%8F%E4%BB%99%E5%9D%9B%E7%AA%91%E5%9D%80%2C_2021-02-14_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​上虞小仙坛窑址","width":320,"height":214}}